Z||000004||Viper||01-12-2000||01:38 AM||||HEY, Viper here......<P>Just reading through the form, and thought I might clarify what WinAMP is.<P>WinAMP is a program to play (.MP3) music files.  Mp3 music files are small (3-5mb.) files which can hold basically cd-quality audio....it is a great technology.!<P>So the "skins" for this program means it gives the music file player a different look, and makes it have girls, or people, or whatever on the player itself........it's kinda like Wallpaper for your desktop, it's a change of face for an "MP3" audio player.<P>Hoped that helped!!!<P>PS. (A good place for MP3's is <A HREF="http://www.audiofind.com," TARGET=_blank>www.audiofind.com,</A>  <A HREF="http://www.oth.net," TARGET=_blank>www.oth.net,</A>  and <A HREF="http://welcome.to/musiclover/" TARGET=_blank>http://welcome.to/musiclover/</A> <P>Check em out!!<P>Download this WINAMP program at <A HREF="http://www.winamp.com!!" TARGET=_blank>www.winamp.com!!</A> <P>Hope I helped people!!<P>-Viper (Derek)||||reg||3
