Z||000006||Monkeyman||03-17-2000||11:39 AM||||My reply should definitely go in O/T, but...you should check out <A HREF="http://www.hotbar.com" TARGET=_blank>www.hotbar.com</A>  if you're interested in changing the look of your computer.  Hotbar is a program that uses different scenes as a background for your internet toolbar.  Kinda neat.  It sure livens up the boring (IMO) toolbar.  (BTW-it's free.)||||reg||1
